Domain Entity Location
    documentation 'This entity represents the physical space where students gather for a particular 
                  'class/section. The Location may be an indoor or outdoor area designated for the 
                  'purpose of meeting the educational needs of students.
    allow primary key updates
    reference School
        documentation 'Relates the Location to the school.
        is part of identity
    string ClassroomIdentificationCode
        documentation 'A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to a room by a school, school 
                      'system, state, or other agency or entity.
        is part of identity
        min length 1
        max length 20
    integer MaximumNumberOfSeats
        documentation 'The most number of seats the class can maintain.
        is optional
    integer OptimalNumberOfSeats
        documentation 'The number of seats that is most favorable to the class.
        is optional